  "failures": [],
  "frame": "1 Blender unit = 1 stud. The tip is at the origin and the cue runs along Blender -Y (tip to butt); the glTF exporter (+Y up) maps Blender (x, y, z) to glTF (x, z, -y), so the cue runs along glTF/Roblox local +Z with the tip at z = 0. The UV seam is at theta = 0, Blender -Z = Roblox local -Y (down in the hand). theta runs seam -> +X -> +Z (top) -> -X. Studio: the MeshPart is centred on its bounds, so PivotOffset = CFrame.new(0, 0, -length / 2) puts the pivot on the tip with +Z toward the butt.",
